    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/e393674c8ef1b5282921da03e92a8f0a.poster.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/e393674c8ef1b5282921da03e92a8f0a.webm?t=1749477521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pixel art adventure you'll play as Psycasso\u00ae, a struggling gallery artist living in an open world city. By day you'll work a day job to earn money and level up skills, seamlessly blending into society. By night you'll be on the lookout to harvest 'red paint' from one of the 'walking meat-bags' to help you create original 2D art. Sell your artwork to art galleries for huge profits! Become rich from your unique artwork while avoiding capture from the ever growing police presence using stealth techniques and unique traps. Buy  property, upgrades, furniture, weapons, discover a bustling city and play a host of mini games in this controversial indie title like nothing before.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/ac1488e7867fb9f9c349807710cd6129.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=268 /></span> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/5b516f6f69ddeb18823e0db06a623e12.poster.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/5b516f6f69ddeb18823e0db06a623e12.webm?t=1749477521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u25d8 2D Painting  <br>\u25d8 Art Gallery Missions &amp; Auctions  <br>\u25d8 Open World City Environment  <br>\u25d8 Skill Leveling and Upgrades  <br>\u25d8 Day/Night System<br>\u25d8 32Bit Pixel Art Graphics  <br>\u25d8 Purchasable Properties &amp; Furniture Upgrades<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/40f3d158ff6f3a5d790601c8f4af0731.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=236 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/ab20ae9723ac209912117618f7e7545a.poster.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/ab20ae9723ac209912117618f7e7545a.webm?t=1749477521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>\u29be Fishing\u00a0  <br>\u29be Stealth Mechanics   <br>\u29be Arcade Games  <br> \u29be Additional Weapons &amp; Items  <br>\u29be Narrative Driven Missions   <br>\u29be Additional Building Locations\u00a0   <br>\u29be Additional Map Locations   <br>\u29be Updated Lighting Systems   <br>\u29be Updated VFX   <br>\u29be Updated Audio   <br>\u29be Extended Phone Features   <br>\u29be Community Requested Content  <br>\u29be More Gore!  <br>\u29be More language translations   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/e393674c8ef1b5282921da03e92a8f0a.poster.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/e393674c8ef1b5282921da03e92a8f0a.webm?t=1749477521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pixel art adventure you'll play as Psycasso\u00ae, a struggling gallery artist living in an open world city. By day you'll work a day job to earn money and level up skills, seamlessly blending into society. By night you'll be on the lookout to harvest 'red paint' from one of the 'walking meat-bags' to help you create original 2D art. Sell your artwork to art galleries for huge profits! Become rich from your unique artwork while avoiding capture from the ever growing police presence using stealth techniques and unique traps. Buy  property, upgrades, furniture, weapons, discover a bustling city and play a host of mini games in this controversial indie title like nothing before.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/ac1488e7867fb9f9c349807710cd6129.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=268 /></span> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/5b516f6f69ddeb18823e0db06a623e12.poster.avif?t=1749477521\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3250080/extras/5b51